plates.", "name": "MAN IN GREEN CARDIGAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do I know you?", "name": "GRETCHEN", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Walter. Walter Lindqvist. I'm with the Thursday group.", "name": "MAN IN GREEN CARDIGAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Anyway. I'll be done in a minute.", "name": "WALTER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Gretchen tallies.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Walter scrubs.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're not on the sign-in sheet, Walter.", "name": "GRETCHEN", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody ever is.", "name": "WALTER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then who's been eating all the pie?", "name": "GRETCHEN", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'd say it was me, but I like to be honest.", "name": "WALTER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She checks the clock.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Still 8:10.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "She shakes her head and goes back to counting.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}